                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>CPC Fill Rate (%)</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>: (# of loaded impressions)/(# of available slots); shows the share of vendors loaded in actual positions, among all slots available for sponsored positions. Note that a fill rate &gt; 100% is observed for certain placements, indicating overfilling.</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
