                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Definition &amp; Use Guidelines:</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>CPC Impressions Share (%)</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>: (# of viewed sponsored impressions)/(# of viewed sponsored+organic impressions); shows the share of sponsored impressions (in a position, placement etc.)</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>As of Q2 2024; Implementation covers majorly &apos;Food&apos; vertical. Local Shops aren&apos;t completely implemented across all screens. Additionally, impressions from &apos;Web&apos; are not completely implemented for all entities.</run>
