                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>(#of requests with loaded slot N )/(# of requests);</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>shows ratio of slots filled across requests.  The closer this value is to the actual number of slots available in the placement, the closer the Fill Rate would be to 100%. This ratio is </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana' underline='true'>not</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'> the Fill Rate, and is indicative of the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana' underline='true'>trends in overall slot utilisation across different days of the month</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>. As of Q2 2024; Local Shops aren&apos;t xcompletely implemented across all screens. Additionally, impressions from &apos;Web&apos; are not completely implemented for all entities.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='12'>Filters:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
