                <zone fixed-size='162' forceUpdate='true' h='5728' id='41' type-v2='text' w='98908' x='546' y='1955'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Glossary:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>&apos;Viewed&apos; Impressions refer to the on-view event triggered when a user has seen the vendor. This is different from &apos;Loaded&apos; impression, which refers to all vendors loaded in the placement, this monitoring validation is based on clicks, i.e. if a click exists for a vendor in a session, then the corresponding viewed and loaded impressions must also be present. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>As of Q2 2024; Implementation covers majorly &apos;Food&apos; vertical. Local Shops aren&apos;t completely implemented across all screens. Additionally, impressions from &apos;Web&apos; are not completely implemented for all entities.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='12'>Filters:</run>
