                      <formatted-text>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Glossary:</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>This monitoring check the % overlap between Viewed and Loaded impressions, since the implementation progress is different for each entity, there could be cases where there exist viewed impressions for a vendor in a session, but the loaded impressions are missing, these are implementation gaps. Ideally, this overlap </run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>should always be 100% or very close to it. </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='12'>Filters:</run>
