                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Glossary:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>&apos;Viewed&apos; Impressions refer to the on-view event triggered when a user has seen the vendor. This is different from &apos;Loaded&apos; impression, which refers to all vendors loaded in the placement.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>* CTR estimations are based on all CPC clicks not billed CPC clicks.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Verdana' italic='true'>* To expand impressions data by country/entity, click (+) under the Management entity tab on each chart</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9e0000' fontname='Verdana' fontsize='12'>Filters:</run>
